Adapted JS → TypeScript by the phi project. The internal structure of
the returned DOM (`.tool-execution {status}`, `.tool-output expandable`)
is preserved verbatim so the vendored CSS resolves to the original
visual look. Local changes are limited to: (a) using
`escapeHtml` from web-src/util.ts, (b) building the DOM via
`document.createElement` + `innerHTML` and returning the HTMLElement,
(c) adding the `BashCallInput` typed signature.

